WEBVTT

00:07.720 --> 00:10.990
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

00:11.520 --> 00:14.390
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

00:15.030 --> 00:18.020
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

00:18.600 --> 00:21.430
Hibana chirasu Jungle Hare nochi Guu!

00:22.030 --> 00:25.330
Mekurumeku koshitsuki MUCHO

00:25.670 --> 00:28.800
Kodomo nya kiwadoi AMIGO

00:29.440 --> 00:32.470
Kisu shitara suikomaresou

00:32.910 --> 00:35.510
Kowai mono mitasa TONIGHT

00:36.480 --> 00:38.580
Ojikeduitara dame

00:38.580 --> 00:40.320
Oshite osarete GOING

00:40.320 --> 00:42.120
Dokkiri kibun ga iine

00:42.120 --> 00:43.760
Chakkari asa made DANCING

00:43.760 --> 00:45.660
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.660 --> 00:49.060
TROPICANA

00:51.000 --> 00:54.060
Yashi no kokage de tsukamaete

00:54.630 --> 00:57.690
Jirashite tokoton tokoton

00:58.370 --> 01:01.340
Gomen ne anata wa mou toriko

01:02.010 --> 01:05.100
Nigerarenai Jungle Hare nochi Guu!

01:05.650 --> 01:08.550
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

01:09.080 --> 01:12.050
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

01:12.650 --> 01:15.780
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

01:16.320 --> 01:18.380
Hibana chirasu Jungle Hare nochi Guu!

01:24.570 --> 01:26.500
All that snow that was here...

01:27.000 --> 01:28.840
In an instant...

01:31.940 --> 01:34.070
...it all disappeared.

01:37.480 --> 01:38.540
It's like a dream.

01:38.950 --> 01:41.440
Was that snow real?

01:51.400 --> 01:54.230
I can't forget how cold it was...

01:54.230 --> 01:55.260
That's true...

01:55.970 --> 01:58.030
Snow is cold...

02:13.880 --> 02:16.510
...it makes you feel like you're going to
freeze down to your bones...

02:23.730 --> 02:26.290
But, that's all the more reason...

02:38.710 --> 02:40.900
It snows in the city, right?

02:42.380 --> 02:43.370
Of course.

02:43.480 --> 02:48.320
Snow piled on the rooftops of stations and
old churches is white like cotton...

02:48.320 --> 02:52.780
...and the scenery looks like something right
out of a fairy tale.

02:52.860 --> 02:55.050
I see... I'd sure like to see that.

03:00.260 --> 03:02.060
I want to see it, too.

03:02.270 --> 03:03.060
You want to go?

03:03.600 --> 03:04.430
Go?

03:04.670 --> 03:05.670
Let's do it!

03:05.670 --> 03:07.100
Let's go, let's go! Decision made!

03:07.610 --> 03:08.610
Are you serious!?

03:08.610 --> 03:10.630
Bell! Ashio! Pack up!

03:11.740 --> 03:12.770
Pack up?

03:12.840 --> 03:14.400
Are we going to go somewhere?

03:14.710 --> 03:15.440
Back home.

03:15.580 --> 03:17.840
We're going to leave before noon,
so book the flights.

03:17.980 --> 03:19.710
I have to put on some makeup.

03:21.990 --> 03:23.420
She's serious...

03:23.590 --> 03:27.320
Ojou-san, who had been dreading it so much,
is now saying she wants to go home.

03:28.560 --> 03:30.530
It's cold in the city, right?

03:30.690 --> 03:33.560
It makes your skin dry and chapped...

03:33.560 --> 03:34.570
While compared to that...

03:34.570 --> 03:36.060
The jungle is warm.

03:36.270 --> 03:37.530
What was that!?

03:37.600 --> 03:39.230
Ojou-sama's going home!?

03:39.300 --> 03:42.970
And so, perhaps it'd be better to just stay
here and work for her...

03:44.040 --> 03:45.100
Of course that's not better!

03:45.310 --> 03:48.510
The day has finally come for us
to follow our mistress' order
and bring back our ojou-sama!

03:48.680 --> 03:52.740
We have to hurry,
before Ojou-sama changes her mind!

03:52.880 --> 03:53.540
Here we go!

03:58.060 --> 04:00.460
Now, we must hurry and get the suitcase out.

04:00.520 --> 04:03.290
That's right, we have to get Ojou-sama's
winter dress ready also.

04:03.730 --> 04:05.630
Hey, Mom, if we're really going to go...

04:05.630 --> 04:08.190
Shouldn't you say good-bye to the villagers?

04:08.470 --> 04:09.690
Oh, that's true.

04:09.770 --> 04:11.560
Nothing less from you, Guu-chan.
You're so considerate!

04:11.840 --> 04:14.330
I should make my rounds, but I have to
change before that.

04:14.540 --> 04:16.600
You took the words right out of my mouth.

04:16.670 --> 04:18.200
It's because you were slow.

04:18.310 --> 04:19.570
Y-You know!

04:19.710 --> 04:21.910
Haré, don't dally! Get ready!

04:21.980 --> 04:22.670
Sure.

04:22.750 --> 04:24.370
Ashio, can you bring me a suitcase?

04:24.450 --> 04:25.180
Of course!

04:29.120 --> 04:30.420
Ouch...

04:30.520 --> 04:32.180
Geez, what are you doing?

04:32.260 --> 04:33.550
Hurry up and grab that end!

04:33.760 --> 04:38.720
AIRPORT 21: JAPANESE FOOD
& WESTERN FOOD

04:43.130 --> 04:45.030
Haré's going to the city?

04:45.700 --> 04:46.900
You're kidding! Why?

04:47.170 --> 04:49.160
And, you're departing immediately?

04:49.270 --> 04:50.710
Well, this is rather sudden.

04:51.110 --> 04:52.510
Yeah, I know.

04:52.510 --> 04:53.880
I'm sorry that this was so sudden.

04:53.880 --> 04:55.180
N-No, I don't like this.

04:55.180 --> 04:57.150
Haré, you're not going to be here anymore?

04:57.280 --> 04:58.480
Eh?

04:58.580 --> 05:00.210
You're overreacting.

05:00.280 --> 05:03.410
We're going to the city,
but we're definitely coming back.

05:03.520 --> 05:06.220
Oh, when did I say anything about returning?

05:07.290 --> 05:10.060
I don't think I said anything about returning.

05:10.160 --> 05:12.250
I-I didn't hear anything about NOT returning!

05:12.330 --> 05:15.360
Then, we'll compromise and
say that we might come back.

05:15.430 --> 05:17.560
You know, this isn't something to
compromise about!

05:18.140 --> 05:20.600
Haré... If you're gone, Haré...

05:20.670 --> 05:22.830
Oh, Marie, don't be so sad...

05:23.070 --> 05:27.870
W-What happens to all of my future plans!?

05:33.280 --> 05:37.080
You know, isn't the point of
Marie's sorrow a little abnormal?

05:37.220 --> 05:40.520
Breaking up...
that's something that I can't do!

05:40.590 --> 05:43.080
Don't worry, we'll never part from each other!

05:43.290 --> 05:45.060
Hey, you guys have got it twisted, too.

05:45.300 --> 05:46.700
Haré... it makes me lonely.

05:46.760 --> 05:49.600
That's right...
spending every day without Weda...

05:51.040 --> 05:54.060
Haré! Weda!

05:54.870 --> 05:56.970
Well, same for me...

05:58.680 --> 05:59.510
Haré...

06:00.480 --> 06:04.070
When you want to cry,
you can cry in my arms.

06:05.920 --> 06:07.590
I see, you are sad!

06:07.590 --> 06:10.420
All right, Haré, cry as much as you want.

06:11.120 --> 06:13.650
This might be our final farewell
with Haré and company.

06:13.720 --> 06:16.750
All of you, let's see them off
with a jungle ceremony.

06:17.030 --> 06:18.590
Toposte, time for that.

06:22.170 --> 06:25.740
GOODBYE JUNGLE
sung by Elder & Everyone in the Jungle

06:25.740 --> 06:33.800
Today, we part
Goodbye, goodbye

06:33.880 --> 06:37.820
The jungle's a great place,
so come by at least once

06:37.820 --> 06:41.720
The ocarina welcomes you back,
Anytime, welcome back

06:41.720 --> 06:46.220
Goodbye, goodbye

06:46.220 --> 06:51.630
Then, see you again!

06:51.630 --> 06:53.600
Location:
Jungle

06:54.230 --> 06:55.490
Goodbye...

06:56.130 --> 06:58.100
G-Goodbye...

06:59.470 --> 07:02.870
Haré! Make sure to come back!

07:03.310 --> 07:05.300
Goodbye!

07:09.410 --> 07:11.970
Oh, they're gone now...

07:12.050 --> 07:13.380
Weda...

07:17.490 --> 07:22.520
Without Weda, I no longer
have any reason to stay in this world.

07:23.560 --> 07:26.620
Weda, I'll wait for you in heaven!

07:27.000 --> 07:28.900
All of you, don't try to stop me!

07:40.510 --> 07:42.950
It's tough to say goodbye...

07:43.050 --> 07:45.680
Well, you'll have new
introductions in the future.

07:45.750 --> 07:48.010
Think positive! Think positive!

07:48.290 --> 07:51.220
You know, when you say that in this
situation, it makes me feel worse.

07:51.290 --> 07:52.310
Oh, that's right.

07:52.590 --> 07:53.750
What's wrong, Mom?

07:54.090 --> 07:56.220
I forgot to visit one more person.

07:56.990 --> 07:58.150
The doctor.

07:58.230 --> 07:59.700
Oh, that's right...

07:59.860 --> 08:03.420
The fact that we're going to the city
means that I won't have to worry about
the school doc anymore!

08:03.700 --> 08:06.640
I'm going to go say goodbye,
so you can go on ahead.

08:06.740 --> 08:07.230
Sure!

08:07.340 --> 08:08.530
I see, I see.

08:08.970 --> 08:11.070
There are good farewells in this world too!

08:13.310 --> 08:14.910
Doctor, are you here?

08:14.910 --> 08:16.170
Yes, coming!

08:16.310 --> 08:18.780
Oh! Weda-chan.

08:19.480 --> 08:22.580
Oh, I didn't recognize you at first.

08:23.520 --> 08:25.510
That outfit and that makeup
look good on you.

08:25.760 --> 08:26.850
You're really pretty.

08:27.560 --> 08:30.250
Oh, doc, you're so full of jokes!

08:30.460 --> 08:32.760
Why? I'm being serious here...

08:32.760 --> 08:35.160
I'm going to go back home now.

08:35.500 --> 08:37.520
Uh, ah, I see...

08:38.540 --> 08:39.240
Yes.

08:39.240 --> 08:42.610
And I don't think I'll be coming back to this
village, so I came here to say goodbye.

08:42.610 --> 08:43.370
What?

08:46.210 --> 08:48.410
What's up with that? Are you serious?

08:48.580 --> 08:49.570
I'm serious.

08:50.250 --> 08:51.610
That means...

08:52.180 --> 08:53.920
I won't see you ever again?

08:53.920 --> 08:55.550
It sure makes me lonely!

08:55.550 --> 08:56.140
Cruel!

08:56.650 --> 08:58.750
Oh, I need to get going now. See you!

09:05.430 --> 09:06.690
Oh, well...

09:07.130 --> 09:09.620
Don't refuse what comes;
don't chase what leaves.

09:10.330 --> 09:12.500
Weda-chan isn't the only woman out there...

09:18.940 --> 09:19.700
Weda-chan!

09:20.910 --> 09:21.640
Eh?

09:22.480 --> 09:23.240
What is it?

09:24.310 --> 09:25.080
Well...

09:25.080 --> 09:27.480
Why am I trying to hold her back?

09:28.450 --> 09:29.650
It's nothing.

09:29.720 --> 09:30.710
Be careful on your trip.

09:30.920 --> 09:32.390
Yes, thank you.

09:33.860 --> 09:34.690
Goodbye.

09:44.270 --> 09:45.360
Goodbye.

09:48.810 --> 09:49.700
Wow!

09:49.770 --> 09:51.970
This is the first time
I'm getting on an airplane!

09:52.280 --> 09:54.710
Amazing! There's so many people!

09:54.710 --> 09:57.010
Haré-sama, your voice is a little too loud.

09:57.110 --> 09:59.050
Why? Is something bad about that?

09:59.280 --> 10:02.720
You so look like a tourist
from the boonies. It's so pathetic.

10:02.890 --> 10:05.750
Hey, if you have something to say,
say it to my face!

10:05.920 --> 10:07.120
Please take care of our luggage.

10:07.490 --> 10:09.020
Yes, we'll check them in.

10:09.530 --> 10:11.760
Is this all of your luggage to check in?

10:12.060 --> 10:13.690
Oh, I have one more.

10:15.030 --> 10:16.520
I want to check this in, too.

10:16.600 --> 10:18.470
Please be careful, as it's fragile.

10:18.570 --> 10:19.730
Understood.

10:19.840 --> 10:21.270
H-Hold on just a second here!

10:21.740 --> 10:23.410
As I said, Haré-sama, a loud voice...

10:23.410 --> 10:25.170
How can I not shout about this!?

10:25.980 --> 10:27.010
Don't worry.

10:27.010 --> 10:29.210
No, no! That's not the problem here!

10:29.580 --> 10:31.670
Haré, didn't you know?

10:31.850 --> 10:34.550
Those that want to can
board the airplane as cargo!

10:34.650 --> 10:35.780
T-That's a lie!

10:35.920 --> 10:40.880
Oh, then you don't know
that you have to take your shoes off when
you board the airplane, either?

10:41.660 --> 10:42.720
R-Really?

10:43.290 --> 10:44.490
That's a lie.

10:45.200 --> 10:46.860
You really don't know anything!

10:47.700 --> 10:48.430
See ya!

10:52.000 --> 10:52.760
Hey!

10:53.000 --> 10:56.130
Ojou-sama, you and Haré-sama
will board first class.

10:56.210 --> 10:58.110
We'll be in business class.

10:58.680 --> 11:01.800
Is it me? Am I the odd one here?

11:03.080 --> 11:05.640
Oh, it's going to be lonely...

11:06.420 --> 11:07.640
True.

11:08.120 --> 11:11.050
I thought you would hold back Weda, Doctor.

11:11.420 --> 11:12.050
"Don't go!"

11:12.160 --> 11:12.920
"But..."

11:13.260 --> 11:14.380
"Stay by my side!"

11:15.160 --> 11:16.090
"Doctor!"

11:17.160 --> 11:17.820
...like that.

11:18.500 --> 11:21.930
Oh, but the destiny of the two that have gone
their separate ways...

11:23.070 --> 11:25.930
But, perhaps the romance will heat up now
that they've been separated...

11:26.000 --> 11:27.940
A long-distance relationship
might be a good thing...

11:28.010 --> 11:29.560
I know! Penpals!

11:29.710 --> 11:33.140
I'll write letters to Haré, so you should write
letters to Weda, Doctor!

11:33.380 --> 11:37.070
"Absence makes the heart grow yonder."

11:37.580 --> 11:39.240
Right! That's what we should do!

11:39.380 --> 11:41.250
There you go off again...

11:41.920 --> 11:45.450
In the first place, I don't have a right to do
such a thing after everything...

11:47.060 --> 11:47.720
Ah!

11:48.160 --> 11:49.220
Maybe that's it!

11:50.360 --> 11:52.490
The airplane that Haré is in...

11:55.600 --> 11:58.360
Oh, it's been a while
since I last rode an airplane!

11:58.570 --> 12:00.800
Wow, it looks so small!

12:01.000 --> 12:02.900
Hey, Haré, why don't you take a look?

12:06.140 --> 12:08.010
What? Something wrong?

12:09.010 --> 12:10.780
Oh, I get it.

12:10.910 --> 12:12.810
You're scared because
this is your first plane ride!

12:13.380 --> 12:16.510
No, I'm scared more about
Guu than my first plane ride.

12:16.650 --> 12:19.680
Because she's out of sight,
I don't know what she's up to.

12:19.760 --> 12:22.660
The fact that she boarded the
cargo area by herself means...

12:23.430 --> 12:26.830
The more I think about it, the more I feel
weighed down by my worries.

12:27.400 --> 12:30.060
It's all right, you don't have
to worry about it so much.

12:30.170 --> 12:31.500
We'll be there in one leap.

12:31.570 --> 12:32.560
One leap?

12:33.170 --> 12:34.070
I see...

12:34.070 --> 12:37.130
If we get there in only about two hours,
maybe Guu will behave.

12:38.040 --> 12:39.770
How long is a leap?

12:39.840 --> 12:41.970
Let's see... Why don't you ask?

12:42.910 --> 12:44.010
Oh, excuse me.

12:44.750 --> 12:45.910
Yes, how may I help you?

12:46.080 --> 12:49.180
Um, how long will it be before we arrive at
our destination?

12:49.350 --> 12:50.680
You mean the flight time, right?

12:51.560 --> 12:53.180
Approximately 12 hours.

12:53.520 --> 12:57.290
12... 12 hours!?

13:00.400 --> 13:02.870
Mom... how many more hours?

13:03.730 --> 13:06.830
You know, it hasn't been 5 minutes since the
last time you asked me that.

13:07.470 --> 13:09.000
Y-You think so?

13:09.340 --> 13:11.970
Time feels so slow right now.

13:12.310 --> 13:14.980
Geez, even considering that
this is your first time...

13:14.980 --> 13:16.110
You're a man, right?

13:16.110 --> 13:17.310
Get your act together.

13:18.020 --> 13:20.980
No, Mom is saying that
because she doesn't know...

13:22.320 --> 13:26.220
I wish I could live life without thinking too
much, just like you, Mom...

13:26.660 --> 13:27.660
What was that?

13:27.660 --> 13:29.850
Don't talk about me as if I was some
single-cell organism!

13:30.560 --> 13:31.390
Excuse me.

13:31.630 --> 13:32.090
Yes?

13:32.330 --> 13:35.130
Can I get a toy or something for him?

13:35.130 --> 13:36.390
Of course, at your service.

13:44.340 --> 13:47.010
He's playing now. Good.

13:47.010 --> 13:49.270
All things considered, he's still a child.

13:52.350 --> 13:55.510
It can't hold its shape unless
it's filled with pressure.

13:55.820 --> 13:56.680
Just like me?

13:58.260 --> 14:02.750
Thank you for flying with
Jungle Airlines today.

14:02.990 --> 14:05.550
We have a few words from the captain.

14:05.630 --> 14:08.150
Why am I always so pessimistic?

14:08.530 --> 14:11.560
Everything I think about
goes from bad to worse.

14:12.640 --> 14:14.910
I should be more like Mom and force myself
to think positively!

14:14.910 --> 14:16.670
Today is sunny. Today is sunny...
I should be more like Mom and force myself
to think positively!

14:16.670 --> 14:17.810
Today is sunny. Today is sunny...
I mean, until now...
Nothing has happened!?

14:17.810 --> 14:19.580
I would like to introduce myself.
I mean, until now...
Nothing has happened!?

14:19.580 --> 14:20.980
I am the...

14:20.980 --> 14:21.880
...captain!

14:22.150 --> 14:23.700
Well, nice to meet you all.

14:23.810 --> 14:25.180
NOOOOOOO!

14:25.180 --> 14:26.650
This voice is one that I've heard way too
many times!

14:26.650 --> 14:27.980
Hare, you're being noisy.

14:29.120 --> 14:31.620
N-No. This is just my normal negativity.

14:31.620 --> 14:32.990
...That Guu is the captain...

14:32.990 --> 14:34.790
T-That's impossible...

14:35.090 --> 14:38.430
This is my first flight,
so I hope you bear with me.

14:38.430 --> 14:39.360
No, no, no!

14:39.460 --> 14:40.200
Positive thinking, it can't be Guu...

14:40.200 --> 14:42.700
Geez, you're being inconsiderate
to the other passengers.
Positive thinking, it can't be Guu...

14:42.700 --> 14:43.200
Positive thinking, it can't be Guu...

14:43.200 --> 14:48.160
Well, this is the first time I'm piloting a plane,
so the plane may sway a bit...
Positive thinking, it can't be Guu...

14:48.340 --> 14:50.900
What? The first time!?
W-W-W-What's the meaning behind that!?

14:50.970 --> 14:53.240
Well, take it with a grain of salt,
don't worry about it.

14:53.480 --> 14:55.210
It's her! I'm 100% sure it's her!

14:55.310 --> 14:58.150
I'm sure she had that smile of hers when she
said that last line!

14:58.580 --> 14:59.240
Yo!

14:59.620 --> 15:03.580
It's her! It's her! I'm positive it is!

15:05.920 --> 15:08.980
Can't you hear me telling you that you're
being too noisy!?

15:09.190 --> 15:10.750
B-But, listen to that voice...

15:10.830 --> 15:11.330
To what?

15:11.330 --> 15:12.520
The captain's voice...

15:12.700 --> 15:16.530
Then, please take your time to enjoy your
journey in the skies... or something like that.

15:16.700 --> 15:18.570
T-That was Guu's voice, right?

15:18.640 --> 15:19.760
Oh, you're right!

15:19.840 --> 15:20.530
See?

15:20.600 --> 15:23.440
That was really similar!
It sounded just like Guu-chan!

15:23.440 --> 15:25.370
Not "just like" her! That totally was her!

15:25.440 --> 15:27.930
Female captains are doing their best, huh?

15:28.280 --> 15:32.870
No, I mean, you should be surprised
by the fact that Guu is the captain,
instead of praising her!

15:33.550 --> 15:34.920
Guu-chan, the captain?

15:34.990 --> 15:37.220
You sure have a vivid imagination.

15:37.850 --> 15:42.150
Why is whatever a child
says always dismissed?

15:42.260 --> 15:44.350
Then, I'll use the perk of being a kid...

15:44.630 --> 15:47.150
I-I want to see the cockpit.

15:47.700 --> 15:50.960
I want to see an awesome
female pilot flying the plane!

15:51.230 --> 15:52.790
Oh, that's a good idea.

15:53.200 --> 15:56.430
Your child was given special
permission to visit the cockpit.

15:56.710 --> 16:00.010
I'm sure Mom, after seeing Guu on top of
hearing the voice...

16:01.910 --> 16:03.540
Captain, you have visitors.

16:04.350 --> 16:06.080
Welcome. I'm surprised you made it.

16:06.320 --> 16:08.440
See! It really is Guu!

16:08.750 --> 16:11.620
Oh, not just her voice,
her face resembles Guu too!

16:12.120 --> 16:14.890
They don't just look alike!
I'm sure it's really her!

16:15.060 --> 16:16.290
Captain, your orders?

16:16.390 --> 16:17.060
Right.

16:17.060 --> 16:18.490
And all of you, too...

16:18.600 --> 16:19.690
Starboard okay!

16:19.800 --> 16:20.660
Starboard okay!

16:20.760 --> 16:21.990
Port okay!

16:22.130 --> 16:23.030
Port okay!

16:23.200 --> 16:24.330
Backwards, all right!

16:24.430 --> 16:25.370
Backwards, all right!

16:25.500 --> 16:26.700
Cap lock OK!

16:26.800 --> 16:28.070
Cap lock OK!

16:28.540 --> 16:29.400
Any cigarette butts and trash?

16:29.510 --> 16:31.030
None! Does this look like a car?

16:31.370 --> 16:31.900
Captain!

16:33.010 --> 16:33.980
We have a problem!

16:34.080 --> 16:35.140
The meters are going wild!

16:36.680 --> 16:38.200
Captain! Captain!

16:38.850 --> 16:41.040
It's just as I thought...

16:41.150 --> 16:42.140
Don't panic.

16:45.220 --> 16:46.380
Now we're okay!

16:47.460 --> 16:48.720
Just as we expect of you, Captain!

16:51.390 --> 16:53.860
That female captain was really cool!

16:54.930 --> 16:56.920
I have no idea what's going on...

16:58.300 --> 17:01.000
Maybe I'm going insane because they rely on
me too much...

17:08.510 --> 17:12.110
You know, about me...
maybe I'm too naive nowadays.

17:12.220 --> 17:14.270
I see hallucinations and stuff...

17:14.520 --> 17:16.250
Maybe you have a fever?

17:16.320 --> 17:17.810
Why don't you hurry up and go to sleep?

17:17.890 --> 17:19.490
It'll be another 10 hours.

17:19.490 --> 17:22.360
Mom, can't you react in a
more sympathetic way?

17:22.490 --> 17:24.190
With love, eh?

17:24.460 --> 17:25.690
Are you all right?

17:25.760 --> 17:28.960
Perhaps you're tired from being in an
airplane that you're not used to, Haré.

17:29.270 --> 17:34.600
Saying that after making a face that
obviously wasn't up to doing anything...

17:35.040 --> 17:38.970
Sir, it's almost lunch, so please choose
something from the menu.

17:39.080 --> 17:40.370
Oh, thanks...

17:43.580 --> 17:45.280
M-M-M-M-M-Mom!

17:45.480 --> 17:47.010
Geez, what is it this time?

17:47.120 --> 17:48.550
G-G-G-Guu!

17:49.920 --> 17:52.590
We have a western course meal, and a
Japanese course meal...

17:52.590 --> 17:53.890
Which will it be?

17:53.890 --> 17:56.190
Oh, you're right! She looks exactly like Guu!

17:56.190 --> 17:58.560
Come on, are you going to
let it pass as just a lookalike?

18:02.500 --> 18:03.520
Totally different!

18:03.600 --> 18:04.230
How so?

18:04.400 --> 18:05.890
Oh, I'd like the Japanese meal.

18:05.970 --> 18:06.530
Sure.

18:06.740 --> 18:09.500
Eh? Why? Why doesn't anyone
around me think it's strange?

18:10.110 --> 18:11.600
What should I do?

18:11.680 --> 18:13.470
Maybe I'm the one that's insane...

18:13.580 --> 18:17.710
You know, I'm starting to think that
everything around me is an illusion.

18:18.150 --> 18:23.020
For instance, if those people that I see now
actually look completely different...

18:24.690 --> 18:27.210
...Maybe they're creatures
from another dimension.

18:28.260 --> 18:31.020
Oh, I'm so hungry!

18:31.460 --> 18:34.360
No! This line of thought is pretty scary,
so I'll stop.

18:35.100 --> 18:37.120
I'm looking forward to the meal!

18:37.300 --> 18:40.360
Oh, but isn't there a
better medicine for my heart?

18:40.440 --> 18:44.430
At this rate, I'll die from the
stress caused by my worries!

18:45.010 --> 18:46.370
Wait! From something I made up myself...

18:46.440 --> 18:47.380
That's right!

18:47.440 --> 18:51.610
Everything up until now is an illusion that I
created because I fear Guu so much!

18:52.420 --> 18:53.940
That's right! That's it!

18:54.050 --> 18:57.110
If I can think of it that way, I can feel at ease,
even just for a little bit!

18:57.290 --> 18:58.150
Here you go.

18:59.060 --> 19:00.820
Oh! This looks good.

19:00.820 --> 19:02.120
It's been a while since I've had caviar.

19:05.300 --> 19:06.390
Don't worry! Don't worry!

19:06.530 --> 19:09.030
It's all an illlusion
that my weak self has created!

19:09.030 --> 19:11.020
Well, how about some coffee?

19:13.040 --> 19:14.440
Haré, you dropped this.

19:14.840 --> 19:16.240
T-Thanks, Guu.

19:16.670 --> 19:17.370
Sure.

19:19.840 --> 19:21.670
Wait, you really are Guu!

19:24.110 --> 19:24.980
Well, of course!

19:25.050 --> 19:27.380
Or, perhaps you couldn't tell just by looking?

19:28.250 --> 19:30.550
Now, I guess I'll go
back to piloting this thing.

19:30.650 --> 19:33.020
So that captain a
few minutes ago really was you!

19:33.090 --> 19:33.850
Hold on just a minute!

19:33.920 --> 19:35.910
You can't fly this plane, can you!?

19:35.990 --> 19:36.980
Hey, wait!

19:37.560 --> 19:39.390
Geez, you're being too noisy!

19:39.530 --> 19:41.260
You're ruining the fine meal here!

19:41.630 --> 19:42.720
Mom...

19:43.270 --> 19:46.170
I can't, I can't, I can't take it anymore!

19:46.400 --> 19:47.670
What are you talking about?

19:48.510 --> 19:49.560
That's enough nonsense!

19:49.870 --> 19:51.670
That's it, we're doomed!

19:52.140 --> 19:55.510
I'm sorry... I was such a
good-for-nothing son.

19:55.680 --> 19:57.670
But, I love you, Mom!

19:58.080 --> 19:59.610
Geez... shut up.

19:59.950 --> 20:02.120
I'm glad I was born as your child.

20:02.120 --> 20:03.090
You're going to heaven!

20:20.970 --> 20:21.960
Where is this?

20:22.070 --> 20:23.840
We've arrived at the airport.

20:23.840 --> 20:26.310
We're all right? We're still alive?

20:26.810 --> 20:28.330
I-I'm so glad!

20:29.610 --> 20:33.510
Sometimes you talk about a world
that I don't know about.

20:34.920 --> 20:37.720
I'm sure I was just having a bad dream.

20:38.560 --> 20:40.820
It's so wonderful to be alive!

20:42.060 --> 20:43.690
Geez, stop fooling around.

20:43.760 --> 20:45.630
We have to get Guu-chan
from the claim area.

20:47.330 --> 20:49.130
Get... Guu?

20:50.870 --> 20:51.360
Yo!

20:54.500 --> 20:57.060
So, it wasn't a dream.

20:58.540 --> 21:00.410
Now, we're in the city!

21:00.510 --> 21:01.810
The city, huh...

21:01.880 --> 21:03.350
It will be all right.

21:03.450 --> 21:06.310
We'll be sure to guard you,
no matter what dangers await!

21:07.150 --> 21:08.140
Dangers?

22:33.020 --> 22:34.680
NEXT EPISODE

22:34.680 --> 22:36.090
Whew! We're finally in the city

22:36.090 --> 22:37.110
I see, so this is were my mom grew up.

22:37.220 --> 22:38.990
There are buildings everywhere. It almost seems like a concrete jungle.

22:38.990 --> 22:40.760
Wait, it's freezing! It's the middle of winter over here!

22:40.760 --> 22:43.060
Oh, I wish the person picking us up would come quickly. At this rate, I'm
going to catch a cold.

22:43.060 --> 22:43.460
Oh, here he comes.

22:43.460 --> 22:45.660
Oh, I see... at first glance,
he seems like a decent guy. I'm glad.

22:45.660 --> 22:46.900
Wait, we suddenly enter a gunfight?

22:46.900 --> 22:47.960
And a car chase?

22:47.960 --> 22:49.130
The suspension is bouncy, the tires squeal...

22:49.130 --> 22:50.030
A faint smell of gunpowder...

22:50.030 --> 22:51.070
And a strange couple chasing after us...

22:51.070 --> 22:52.540
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, WAIT!!

22:52.540 --> 22:54.000
No matter how you look at them,
they're a normal couple!

22:54.070 --> 22:56.160
Listen, or rather, just let me out!

22:56.310 --> 22:57.840
Next episode of Haré+Guu: "Robert-san"

22:57.840 --> 22:58.840
Next episode of Haré+Guu: "Robert-san"
